      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, that's fine. just go ahead and give me those economic arguments. can you list out the main ways these costs will impact us, like on margins and competitiveness, and also maybe briefly touch on why people support these regs so i can see what i'm up against? just keep it professional.",
